<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="data-service-retry">
  <title>Echo text through the service</title>
  <body>
    <section>
      <title>Check that the service is ready</title>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"data-service-ready","onPass":[{"if":["$$platform oneOf [linux, mac, windows]"],"goToTest":"data-echo-text"}],"onFail":[{"if":"$$platform oneOf [linux, mac, windows]","stop":"spec"}],"detectSteps":true}'/>
      <p>The service can take a few seconds to start, so wait five seconds before you check it.</p>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"wait":true}'/>
      <p>Check that the service is ready. If the check fails, check again after a short wait:</p>
      <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "const fs=require('fs'),f=require('path').join(require('os').tmpdir(),'doc-detective-docs-ready');if(fs.existsSync(f)){fs.rmSync(f)}else{fs.writeFileSync(f,'');console.error('Not ready yet.');process.exit(1)}"</codeblock>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":"node -e \"const fs=require(&apos;fs&apos;),f=require(&apos;path&apos;).join(require(&apos;os&apos;).tmpdir(),&apos;doc-detective-docs-ready&apos;);if(fs.existsSync(f)){fs.rmSync(f)}else{fs.writeFileSync(f,&apos;&apos;);console.error(&apos;Not ready yet.&apos;);process.exit(1)}\"","onFail":[{"if":"$$outputs.exitCode == 1","retry":{"limit":3,"delay":500,"backoff":"exponential"}}]}'/>
      <p>This example simulates a service that isn't ready the first time you check.</p>
      <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>Restart the service</title>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"data-service-restart","detectSteps":true}'/>
      <p>If the service still isn't ready, restart it:</p>
      <codeblock outputclass="language-shell">node -e "console.log('Restarting the service.')"</codeblock>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"runShell":"node -e \"console.log(&apos;Restarting the service.&apos;)\""}'/>
      <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
    </section>
    <section>
      <title>Echo text</title>
      <data name="doc-detective" value='test {"testId":"data-echo-text","publicVariables":["ECHOED"],"runOn":[{"retries":2}],"onWarning":[{"continue":true}],"onSkip":[{"stop":"spec"}],"detectSteps":true}'/>
      <ol>
        <li>Go to <xref href="http://localhost:8092/type-echo.html" scope="external" format="html">the type echo page</xref>.</li>
        <li>Click <b>Type here:</b>.</li>
        <li>Type "Hello, Doc Detective".</li>
        <li>Check that the page shows <b>Hello, Doc Detective</b> below the field. If it doesn't, type the text again.</li>
        <li>Send the text to the messages API. Send a <codeph>POST</codeph> request to <codeph>http://localhost:8093/api/messages</codeph> with this body:
          <codeblock outputclass="language-json">{"text": "Hello, Doc Detective"}</codeblock>
          <p>The API returns the same text.</p>
          <data name="doc-detective" value='step {"httpRequest":{"url":"http://localhost:8093/api/messages","method":"post","request":{"body":{"text":"Hello, Doc Detective"}},"response":{"body":{"text":"Hello, Doc Detective"}}}}'/></li>
      </ol>
      <data name="doc-detective" value="test end"/>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>
